@Gateway_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000
@Identity_HostAddress = http://localhost:5001

### Gateway: Register via YARP — 201 (Anonymous)
POST {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "gateway-smoke@example.com",
  "password": "P@ssw0rd123",
  "fullName": "Gateway Smoke"
}

###

### Gateway: Register duplicate → 409
POST {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "gateway-smoke@example.com",
  "password": "P@ssw0rd123",
  "fullName": "Gateway Smoke"
}

###

### Gateway: Login via YARP — 200 with token
# @name login
POST {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "gateway-smoke@example.com",
  "password": "P@ssw0rd123"
}

###

### Gateway: Login invalid → 401
POST {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "gateway-smoke@example.com",
  "password": "wrongpass"
}

###

### Gateway: Me via YARP — 200 with Bearer token
GET {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

###

### Gateway: Me without token → 401
GET {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me

###

### Gateway: Me with invalid token → 401
GET {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.invalid

###

### Gateway: Orders route — 401 without token (ClientPolicy)
GET {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Accept: application/json

###

### Gateway: Orders route — 201 create via YARP (ClientPolicy, uses token from login above)
# @name createdOrder
POST {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

{
  "cargoType": "General",
  "weightKg": 120.5,
  "volumeM3": 2.3,
  "origin": "Kyiv, UA",
  "destination": "Warsaw, PL",
  "description": "Smoke via Gateway",
  "declaredValue": 5000,
  "deadline": "2026-09-30T12:00:00Z"
}

###

### Gateway: Orders route — list via YARP (Client sees own)
GET {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

###

### Gateway: Orders route — get by id via YARP
GET {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/orders/{{createdOrder.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

###

### Gateway: Orders route — update status via YARP (Client Cancel)
PUT {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/orders/{{createdOrder.response.body.$.id}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

{
  "newStatus": 5,
  "notes": "Client cancel smoke"
}

###

### Gateway: Orders route — update status invalid transition → 409 (Created -> Delivered blocked)
PUT {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/orders/{{createdOrder.response.body.$.id}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

{
  "newStatus": 4,
  "notes": "Invalid jump"
}

###

### Direct Identity (bypass YARP) — 201 for comparison
POST {{Identity_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "direct-smoke@example.com",
  "password": "P@ssw0rd123",
  "fullName": "Direct Smoke"
}

###
